+                            <p>Herriman has grown quickly, and most of its homes are newer than those in the rest of the valley. Rosecrest, the city&#x27;s largest master-planned community, spreads across more than 2,500 acres of Oquirrh foothills near Blackridge Reservoir. Herriman Towne Center surrounds City Hall, the library, and the J.L. Sorenson Recreation Center, while Anthem and the neighborhoods along the Mountain View Corridor keep adding new streets.</p>
