+                            <p>Our address is 9256 Targhee Dr, in the 84088 ZIP code on the city&#x27;s southwest side. That puts us close to every corner of West Jordan, from the older streets near Redwood Road to the newer subdivisions climbing toward the Oquirrh Mountains along the Mountain View Corridor. With 24-hour availability Monday through Thursday, we&#x27;re set up for the weekday-morning call when a broken spring leaves the car stuck inside.</p>
+                            <p>West Jordan grew in waves, and you can read those waves in its garages. Neighborhoods near Redwood Road and Veterans Memorial Park include plenty of ramblers and split-levels whose doors may still lift on extension springs that run along the tracks. Farther west, around Copper Hills High School and the subdivisions off 7800 South and 9000 South, homes are newer, with two- and three-car garages, torsion springs above the door, and openers now reaching the age when gears and circuit boards start to fail.</p>
